    "detailed_description": "The Forgotten Village of Gondomayit lets you experience the mystical atmosphere of Indonesia.<br />\r\nTells the story of a young man named Bagas, a vocational school student<br />\r\nwho lost the bet and received a challenge from his friends. He had to test his courage in one of the boarding houses in Gondomayit Village, which had long been abandoned by the residents after the eruption of Mount Merapi. However, many strange things happened when they first arrived at the village. Starting from a scary and lonely atmosphere,<br />\r\nthe appearance of strange creatures, full of puzzles and much more.<br />\r\nAnd this game is also very interactive because there are missions that must be completed, starting from looking for clues as to why the boarding house is so haunted.<br />\r\nDesigned and developed from the ground up for fully immersive atmosphere and gameplay,<br />\r\nThe Forgotten Village of Gondomayit is our approach to a truly unsettling and terrifying experience.",
    "about_the_game": "The Forgotten Village of Gondomayit lets you experience the mystical atmosphere of Indonesia.<br />\r\nTells the story of a young man named Bagas, a vocational school student<br />\r\nwho lost the bet and received a challenge from his friends. He had to test his courage in one of the boarding houses in Gondomayit Village, which had long been abandoned by the residents after the eruption of Mount Merapi. However, many strange things happened when they first arrived at the village. Starting from a scary and lonely atmosphere,<br />\r\nthe appearance of strange creatures, full of puzzles and much more.<br />\r\nAnd this game is also very interactive because there are missions that must be completed, starting from looking for clues as to why the boarding house is so haunted.<br />\r\nDesigned and developed from the ground up for fully immersive atmosphere and gameplay,<br />\r\nThe Forgotten Village of Gondomayit is our approach to a truly unsettling and terrifying experience.",
    "short_description": "Bagas, a native of Yogyakarta, is a vocational school student who lost a bet and received a challenge from his friends, he had to test his courage in one of the boarding houses in Gondomayit Village, whose residents had long been abandoned after the eruption of Mount Merapi.",
